  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/P1660831.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Este viernes se ha iniciado en Onda una nueva edici&oacute;n de la Feria Medieval, que se desarrollar&aacute; hasta el domingo con el centro hist&oacute;rico, desde la plaza del Almud&iacute;n o Font de Dins</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/P1660882.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>hasta el castillo, con la fortaleza como gran protagonista, &quot;la &uacute;nica de estas caracter&iacute;sticas donde se desarrolla un evento de estas caracter&iacute;sticas&quot;, seg&uacute;n el Ayuntamiento.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresfiramedieval17/p1660762.jpg\" alt=\"p1660762\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresfiramedieval17/p1660764.jpg\" alt=\"p1660764\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresfiramedieval17/p1660765.jpg\" alt=\"p1660765\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresfiramedieval17/p1660768.jpg\" alt=\"p1660768\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresfiramedieval17/p1660770.jpg\" alt=\"p1660770\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresfiramedieval17/p1660772.jpg\" alt=\"p1660772\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresfiramedieval17/p1660774.jpg\" alt=\"p1660774\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2